		<div class="last_chap uk-visible-small"></div>
		<div class="summary uk-hidden-small">[Innate Ability: Resurrection]<br><br>"What? What's with this super OP cheat skill?"<br><br>However, Kang Hyeon didn't know what it meant to die, want to die, and not being able to.<br><br>The man who became the most infamous hunter on Earth with his immortal body!<br><br>"As a human disaster - no, as one against the disasters facing the human race,I will solo resurrect today as well!"</div>
