		<div class="last_chap uk-visible-small"></div>
		<div class="summary uk-hidden-small">In a prison so big that it is called a city, all sorts of criminals have been amassed. Due to the inescapable walls, the population only continues to grow. Within are a pair of siblings - a young girl and a recently born boy. What will be their fate in this desolate, cold city...? A story of hope and struggle begins.</div>
