		<a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/action">Action</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/adventure">Adventure</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/fantasy">Fantasy</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/horror">Horror</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/shounen">Shounen</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/supernatural">Supernatural</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/manhwa">Manhwa</a><a href="https://mangakatana.com/genre/webtoon">Webtoon</a>		</div>
		<div class="last_chap uk-visible-small"></div>
		<div class="summary uk-hidden-small">The world is ending. Monsters from legends appear everywhere. They eat people, conquer the streets, and begin to make dungeons in the buildings and subways. If you could choose one job in this decrepit world, what would you choose? For a “necromancer” extinction is my playground and death is my wealth.</div>
